From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 22:09:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] Fix route tests and check ownership before Pin-Down
 write-back

Route tests failed because routes now read the active workspace (cookies)
and the tests never mocked it. Add the workspace mock, add offset and
onConflictDoNothing to the fake db, and rewrite the Pin-Down route test
for the route's current contract.

Pin-Down's GET ran applyResolvableFacts before checking the engagement
belongs to the caller, so any signed-in user could trigger config
write-back for another workspace's client. Check ownership first.

