From cf62722ca62905dbf923c6b9529967dd551a94b5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 22:21:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/7] Run the website and account work that was wired to
 nothing

Cold Open: resolveColdOpenDerivedFields was never called. discoverClient
now runs it, and each resolver runs on its own so one failure no longer
skips the rest. The resolver stored Claude's extraction as a Jev score
of 85, a default tone at 80, and a 'Main Product' placeholder; Jev now
scores the extraction against the site copy, that score is the stored
confidence, and nothing is invented when a value isn't found. The
product URL comes from the client's domain.

Model readings of the site (operator name, offer name, price, ICP,
vertical) are saved with a new 'llm' source that field-writeback never
trusts outright; verifyWebsiteReadings has Jev score them before they
can auto-apply. Offer price, vertical and the hero video embed were
found by the crawl and thrown away; they're now saved.

Connecting a CRM only crawled when no domain existed, which does
nothing. discoverClientIfNotYetCrawled crawls when a domain is known and
the site hasn't been crawled, after Composio, GHL and paste-a-key
harvests. Reusing a saved credential now runs that provider's harvest.

Remove the Instantly, Smartlead, Lemlist, Reply.io and Whop harvesters
from account-harvest: only Composio reaches it and it has none of them.
GHL social handles were saved as a list into a platform -> handle map;
they're keyed by platform now and the writeback rejects lists. Leak Map
and Daily Send default to the harvested client timezone instead of UTC.

